## Noncommercial Organizations

Use by any charitable organization, educational institution, public research organization, public safety or health organization, or environmental protection organization is use for a permitted purpose regardless of the source of funding or obligations resulting from the funding, unless that organization is a government entity under [Government Use](#government-use).

## Government Use

Use by, for, or on behalf of any government entity is not a permitted purpose, whether or not it is commercial.  A **government entity** is any government, state, or municipal body, ministry, department, agency, authority, or institution, and any company or other organization that is owned or controlled by any of them.  **Controlled** has the meaning given to **control** in [Definitions](#definitions).

This section does not limit personal use by an individual on their own behalf and not for a government entity.  A government entity may use the software only under a separate written license from the licensor.

